  "interpretation": "Legacy replay pilot improvement is not sufficient for retention. The wider fixture set retains every threshold flag, including native total. Three pairs on a shared host do not establish causal regressions, statistical equivalence or universal performance. Probe remains outside candidate; further decision and qualification required.",
  "retained_failure": "Initial MSRV tests passed, then fmt check failed. Rustfmt only wrapped configuration arguments and added an optional trailing comma. Both exact source snapshots and an exact replacement check retained. A naive whitespace-only assertion refused the added comma; corrected formatting check did not change an expression. Followup reran fmt/Clippy and built measured binaries from formatted source.",
  "limits": "Three paired stable processes per full existing fixture, median of per-run quantiles, all descriptive threshold findings retained. Not pooled percentiles, significance or universal equivalence. MSRV runs test compatibility and are excluded from timing summary.",
  "conditions": "CPU4 except machine_store4-7; builds/tests complete before timing. NVMe Btrfs data. Both chaos campaigns8-15/16-23 and shared host remain uncontrolled. Retained original candidate binaries from versioned capability refresh.",
